text = "consumed by a runaway greenhouse effect,
the ravaged earth sought salvation in technology. 
however, by 2022 it became clear that there was no
miracle technology that could save the world. 
when the summit in ottawa ended in april 2022, only
one scientist remained optimistic: professor john merrick. 
he proposed exploding thermonuclear devices at both
poles to surround the world with a layer of opaque
 clouds and thus cool down the world. 
approved by the united nations in october, the
operation was slated for december 24, 2022."
horizontal_alignment = 1
